## third-party material, never committed (CLAUDE.md §4.1)
/reference-works/
## the scratch copies of each step (CLAUDE.md §2.6)
/.scratch/
## the metadata that the Finder of macOS leaves in each folder
.DS_Store
## the raw output of the experiments, regenerated by their scripts (rules of the experiments, §4)
/design/experiments/**/results/raw/
## the environment of development that uv makes in the checkout
/.venv/
## the bytecode that Python caches beside each module
__pycache__/
## the metadata that setuptools writes for the editable installation
*.egg-info/
## the cache of pytest, from which it reruns the tests that last failed
/.pytest_cache/
